### Restore shared settings configuration in finally

**Severity:** `medium`

Cleanup currently restores shared process state only after the UI-thread assertions succeed. A timeout or enqueue failure would leave the replacement settings configuration installed for later tests. Keep the UI shutdown assertions, but restore the shared configuration in `finally`.

```suggestion
               try
               {
                   if (dispatcher != null)
                   {
                       Assert.IsTrue(dispatcher.TryEnqueue(() => Application.Current.Exit()));
                       Assert.IsTrue(uiThread.Join(Timeout), "The test XAML thread did not exit.");
                   }
               }
               finally
               {
                   SettingsConfigField.SetValue(repository, previousSettingsConfig);
               }
```
